  "measured": {"blind_agreement": ["73 of 89", "89 of 106"], "note": "A floor computed from paths alone agreed with careful independent labels about five times in six, and under-rated roughly one data-or-critical path in six. That is why the contract's declared profile and the agent's own judgement sit above the floor, and why a unit records the floor beside the declared profile."}
